sentences.text:
Learned counsel for the petitioner would submit that the petitioner has been in possession of land admeasuring 240 sq.yards, situated at Gandhipuram, Anantharam Village, Mahabubabad Mandal and District (for short 'subject property'); that respondent No.5 vide proceedings No.C/29/2014,
dated 09.02.2014, issued house site certificate to the petitioner under Indiramma Housing Scheme;
that petitioner has constructed a tin shed in the subject property and has been residing in the same;
and that the petitioner has been paying taxes regularly and also obtained electricity connection to the said house.
